<!--
  Channels that get a TV schedule (now / next) in Free TV.

  The "Update TV guide" step of the Pages workflow downloads these schedules with the
  iptv-org/epg grabber (https://github.com/iptv-org/epg) and turns them into small JSON
  files under guide/. To add a channel, find it in one of the sites/<site>/*.channels.xml
  files of that repository and copy the line here. Set xmltv_id to the channel's tvg-id in
  the playlist (the part before "@" is enough to match other feeds of the same channel).

  A channel may be listed under more than one site: the site that returns the most
  programmes wins, so a second site acts as a backup when the first one fails.
-->
